{
  "_comment": [
    "Symbol table for Bubbler+. Storage is Unicode; \"slot\" is where the same",
    "mark sits in the bundled symbol font, and is the ONLY column that changes",
    "when the font is replaced. If a replacement face puts its glyphs at real",
    "Unicode codepoints, set slot === unicode and toFont() becomes a no-op."
  ],
